+			Use the specified serial port.  The options are of
+			the form "bbbbpnf", where "bbbb" is the baud rate,
+			"p" is parity ("n", "o", or "e"), "n" is number of
+			bits, and "f" is flow control ("r" for RTS or
+			omit it).  Default is "9600n8".
